{
    "title": "Heart Rate Health & BP Monitor",
    "description": "This heart rate health and blood pressure monitor allows you to measure your heart rate easily, quickly and accurately, easily view changes in your heart rate value, understand the health of your heart rate and whether it's within the normal range. You can also learn some related health advice and knowledge to help you record all the data, thus helping you to keep track of your health data.\r\nOur symptom tracker uses heart rate variability to analyse the symptoms of your illness. By simply measuring your heart rate using your smartphone camera or watch, this product can track your symptoms and record any changes in your overall health. You can record your blood pressure data and use our blood pressure check analyser.\r\n1. BLOOD PRESSURE MONITORING: Users simply place their finger on the app's blood pressure sensor and the app automatically measures blood pressure. Users can record the results of each measurement and generate a graph of blood pressure changes in order to track the trend of blood pressure changes.\r\n2. heart rate monitoring: by using the heart rate sensor in the application, users can measure the heart rate quickly and accurately. The application records the results of each measurement and generates a graph of the heart rate so that the user can track the changes in heart rate. \r\n3. Blood Glucose Recording: You can record blood glucose data through the health suite and observe the trend of blood glucose through graphs. \r\n4. Data Analysis and Reporting: The application will analyse the data based on the user's heart rate and blood pressure data and provide health assessment and recommendations. Users can view daily, weekly or monthly health reports to understand their physical condition.\r\n5. Health Analytics: With the in-app data analytics feature, you can easily understand your heart rate and blood pressure trends. You can set goals, track progress and adjust your lifestyle and health habits based on the data.\r\n6. Reminders: The app can provide you with regular measurement reminders based on your settings to ensure that you monitor your heart rate and blood pressure regularly, as well as to help you develop good health habits.\r\nAll-in-one health tracking app\r\n- Detect heart rate with a photoplethysmograph (PPG)\r\n- Get personalised results on stress, sleep, fitness and health with an accurate pulse oximeter\r\n- Assess your stress levels and learn about your health with the symptom checker\r\n- Analyse your heart rate with the Heart Rate Monitor app and perform a stress test with the Heart Rate Checker.\r\nBlood pressure tracker\r\n- Synchronise your sphygmomanometer or manually add blood pressure data for further insights into cardiovascular health\r\n- Record your blood pressure and start managing it with our smart blood pressure tracker!\r\nActivity and Fitness Tracker\r\n- Apply adaptive zones for training \r\n- Compare the impact of different workouts to improve heart health and stress levels\r\n- Track heart rate variability at home to improve heart health and stick to your training programme\r\nStress Tracker\r\n- Keep an eye on stress levels and get guidance on reducing stress\r\n- Get advice on how to cope with stress, panic attacks and insomnia\r\n- Psychological and physiological biofeedback\r\nWe are committed to providing easy-to-use features and ensuring data accuracy and privacy. You can rest assured that you can use the Heart Rate & Blood Pressure Health Monitor app to understand your health status and make timely lifestyle adjustments to improve your overall health.\r\nDownload the Heart Rate & Blood Pressure Monitor app today and start keeping an eye on your heart rate and blood pressure for your health!",
